print           "Surface loading check: Ntop=${Ntop}, Nbot=${Nbot}. If they differ strongly, tune ZTOP_PRESS_MIN."
Surface loading check: Ntop=2440, Nbot=2440. If they differ strongly, tune ZTOP_PRESS_MIN.
write_data      ${CASE}_start.data pair ij
write_data      twist_bto_P12_longhold_start.data pair ij
System init for write_data ...
write_restart   ${CASE}_start.restart
write_restart   twist_bto_P12_longhold_start.restart
System init for write_restart ...

# ------------------------ SMALL PRE-RELAXATION ----------------------------
# No dump is written during this part. This avoids huge unnecessary output and
# keeps the later dump focused on the pressure-induced response.
fix             teth shells spring/self 0.05
fix_modify      teth energy yes
min_style       cg
min_modify      dmax 0.00010 line quadratic
minimize        0.0 1.0e-6 3000 30000
Per MPI rank memory allocation (min/avg/max) = 12.05 | 19.25 | 26.74 Mbytes
